{"availability":"available","full":"M1KUAPP/Kawan","name":"Kawan","description":"A skeptical AI accountability companion that holds you to one commitment and accepts only verified evidence, never self-report, as progress.","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-12T13:54:01Z","updated":"2026-10-08T20:08:11Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://kawan-frontend.vercel.app","topics":["accountability","ai-agents","confidential-computing","fastapi","hackathon","intel-tdx","live2d","llm","pixijs","postgresql","productivity","pwa","python","react","sqlalchemy","structured-outputs","supabase","tee","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://kawan-frontend.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:18.947Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:18.947Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:18.947Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:23:00.842Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:13:37.765Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:18.947Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[][python-url] [][typescript-url] [][react-url] [][vite-url] [][live2d-url] [][fastapi-url] [][sqlalchemy-url] [][sqlite-url] [][postgresql-url] [][supabase-url] [][chutes-url] [][render-url] [][vercel-url] [][uv-url] [][pytest-url]","A skeptical accountability companion. Not a cheerleader. One commitment, verified evidence, no self-report. Earn the trust.","Most habit apps take you at your word. Tap a checkbox, keep the streak, lie to yourself for free. Kawan (Malay for \"friend\") is the opposite: a companion that holds you to one commitment, asks for real evidence, and only believes you once you've shown it."],"features":["One real commitment. A single action + deliverable + deadline. Hard fields you set and only you can change.","Evidence over self-report. Verdicts come from a GitHub repo's commits, an uploaded file, or a screenshot judged by a vision model. There is no \"mark as done\" button you can lie to.","Honest verdicts. Every check-in resolves to pass / fail / unclear. unclear never punishes; a flaky or slow model degrades to it instead of guessing.","Three Live2D companions. Kawan, Adik, and Cik Maid, each a stateless preset of tone + animated model + voice + inference model. Switching the companion changes the messenger, never your commitment.","TEE inference via Chutes. Real check-in lines and evidence judgments run on Chutes' Trusted Execution Environment chutes, with per-persona model routing and an automatic secondary judge on failure. A deterministic…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/M1KUAPP/Kawan/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6504ed6ac171b62311d49f3dd6950493b5df398e7ffdf5f33c422d2e0c403e16","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:19.110Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:19.110Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[][python-url] [][typescript-url] [][react-url] [][vite-url] [][live2d-url] [][fastapi-url] [][sqlalchemy-url] [][sqlite-url] [][postgresql-url] [][supabase-url] [][chutes-url] [][render-url] [][vercel-url] [][uv-url] [][pytest-url]","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/M1KUAPP/Kawan/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"Sign In · Sign in with Chutes, or continue as a guest without an account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/M1KUAPP/Kawan/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"AI and services: Chutes (OpenAI-compatible TEE inference) with Sign in with Chutes (OAuth2 PKCE), a deterministic stub backend, optional Piper neural TTS, the Telegram Bot API and email through Resend.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/M1KUAPP/Kawan/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The app runs fully offline out of the box — the default AI backend is a deterministic stub, so you need no API keys to try it locally.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/M1